<title>FRANCE: Imetal 96 net attributable profit rises.</title>
<headline>Imetal 96 net attributable profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			     614  vs	     596</p>
<p>    Net pre-exceptionals			 606  vs	     551</p>
<p>    Net dividend (francs)		    16.00  vs	   14.50</p>
<p>    Operating				    1,016  vs	     961</p>
<p>    Turnover				     8,100  vs	   7,737</p>
